---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer | Aging at Home Lab" description="Important limits on Aging at Home Lab content, including medical, legal, financial, construction, and safety disclaimers.">
  <article class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Disclaimer</p>
    <h1>Important limits on our guidance.</h1>
    <p>Aging at Home Lab provides general educational information, organization tools, and practical checklists for families thinking through aging-in-place decisions.</p>

    <div class="callout warning">
      <h2>Not professional advice</h2>
      <p>Nothing on this site is medical, legal, financial, construction, occupational therapy, caregiving, or individualized safety advice. Do not use this site as a substitute for a qualified professional who can evaluate the actual person, home, risks, laws, documents, products, or care situation.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>When to get qualified help</h2>
    <p>Talk with a qualified professional before making decisions that affect health, medications, mobility, fall risk, dementia-related safety, legal authority, financial benefits, major home modifications, or emergency planning.</p>

    <h2>Product and safety limits</h2>
    <p>Product categories mentioned on this site may not be appropriate for every person or home. Product instructions, installation requirements, recalls, warnings, and professional recommendations should be checked before purchase or use.</p>

    <h2>Emergency situations</h2>
    <p>If there is an emergency, immediate safety concern, suspected abuse, serious injury, medication emergency, or urgent medical issue, contact emergency services or an appropriate local authority instead of relying on website content.</p>

    <h2>Updates and accuracy</h2>
    <p>We aim to keep guides practical and current, but products, policies, programs, costs, laws, and safety guidance can change. Always verify important details before acting.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
